{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A birthday turns deadly, and the truth is buried beneath layers of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Scarlet Enigma, you take on the role of a rookie detective navigating a tangled web of lies, timelines, and unanswered questions. A young woman is murdered during what should have been a joyful celebration, and it\u2019s up to you to uncover what really happened, before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/3f8e3fec7a9c8b97fd43b48b8b0ab28e.poster.avif?t=1746815946\" width=600 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/3f8e3fec7a9c8b97fd43b48b8b0ab28e.webm?t=1746815946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/3f8e3fec7a9c8b97fd43b48b8b0ab28e.mp4?t=1746815946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a richly detailed world where your decisions drive the investigation. Question dozens of unique characters, piece together clues, solve puzzles, and dive into interactive environments that reward curiosity and intuition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing leads, uncovering betrayals, or decoding the past, every step brings you closer to the killer and deeper into a case that may not be as straightforward as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/3b58f14b57f1618c1bcb4b8d062db355.poster.avif?t=1746815946\" width=600 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/3b58f14b57f1618c1bcb4b8d062db355.webm?t=1746815946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/3b58f14b57f1618c1bcb4b8d062db355.mp4?t=1746815946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven, non-horror murder mystery with time-twisting elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-ended investigation\u2014approach suspects and clues in the order you choose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ original characters with custom art and individual backstories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted environments and immersive scenes to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive notebook to track your findings and theories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and logic challenges that test your detective skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 2\u20133 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/8abb6afd612f154dfd229280b6a21775.poster.avif?t=1746815946\" width=600 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/8abb6afd612f154dfd229280b6a21775.webm?t=1746815946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/8abb6afd612f154dfd229280b6a21775.mp4?t=1746815946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615950?t=1746815946","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3615950?t=1746