st, every step brings you closer to the killer and deeper into a case that may not be as straightforward as it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/3b58f14b57f1618c1bcb4b8d062db355.poster.avif?t=1746815946\" width=600 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/3b58f14b57f1618c1bcb4b8d062db355.webm?t=1746815946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/3b58f14b57f1618c1bcb4b8d062db355.mp4?t=1746815946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven, non-horror murder mystery with time-twisting elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-ended investigation\u2014approach suspects and clues in the order you choose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ original characters with custom art and individual backstories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-painted environments and immersive scenes to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive notebook to track your findings and theories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and logic challenges that test your detective skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly 2\u20133 hours of gameplay</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/8abb6afd612f154dfd229280b6a21775.poster.avif?t=1746815946\" width=600 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615950/extras/8abb6afd612f154dfd22